-- Migration 0103: Batch 2 of the exercise-library enrichment — BARBELL / RACK
--
-- Roadmap X-38. `barbell` had exactly one exercise, so a strength-goal user who
-- ticked "at the gym" was still served bodyweight work. These are the compound
-- lifts a gym session is actually built around.
--
-- Equipment uses the canonical vocabulary (barbell, squat_rack, bench,
-- bench_press_rack, weight_plates, ez_bar), all of which are selectable in
-- ALL_EQUIPMENT, so a home rack owner unlocks them without gym_today.
--
-- Every row carries loads_* injury tags (R563) and safety cues: these are the
-- movements where a bad rep costs the most.

